<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Rugby union-Ashton confirmed as Ireland coach.</title>
<headline>Rugby union-Ashton confirmed as Ireland coach.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brian Ashton has been confirmed as full-time Irish coach until the end of the 2003 World Cup, the Irish Rugby Football Union said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Ashton, who quit English club champions Bath in early January, was appointed Ireland's coaching advisor inside four days following the resignation of New Zealander Murray Kidd.</p>
<p>His appointment comes into effect on April 1.</p>
